  "body": "This solid weatherboard beauty is a perfect marriage of classic craftsmanship. A home that’s absolutely ready to impress and enthral its next visionary owner.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the breadth of living and dining areas with the timber story continuing through, and the bifold doors effectively blur the line between indoors and out. Abundant natural light and a wonderfully imaginative approach to the design mean this is a home that is truly comfortable to live in and will provide the perfect setting for your next phase of life.\r\n\r\nKey features:\r\n- 3 spacious bedrooms\r\n- Open-plan living and dining that flow seamlessly to the outdoors—great for entertaining or relaxing\r\n- Original kitchen, a blank canvas really, a great opportunity to rework the layout and bring your own look and usability to it.\r\n- Bathroom with shower, vanity, and separate toilet\r\n- Dedicated laundry space\r\n- Weatherboard cladding, wooden joinery, and iron roof\r\n- Classic 1960s craftsmanship throughout\r\n\r\nFall in love with timeless style – this home is ready for its next chapter. Book your viewing today.\r\n\r\nContact Abby today, phone/text: 027 473 6682\r\nPBR264",
